{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1456817-detecting-vampires","id":1456817,"title":"Detecting Vampires","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-14T11:19:11-07:00","id":1456817,"title":"Detecting Vampires","content":"Hello there,<br /> <br /> Do the Bound have any means of detecting or identifying someone as a vampire?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25750-holy-hell-thats-hot","name":"Holy-Hell-Thats-Hot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-14T12:52:50-07:00","id":1456827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Holy-Hell-Thats-Hot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1456817-detecting-vampires#post1456817\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello there,<br /> <br /> Do the Bound have any means of detecting or identifying someone as a vampire?</div> </div> </div> </div>Level 1 Oracle Haunt could reveal a vampire as a death touched being","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-11T12:51:51-07:00","id":1483740,"title":"","content":"When in doubt, take a sneaky pic with your camera phone. If its a vamp, it got no reflection and won't show up in the image.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-11T13:13:59-07:00","id":1483741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1456817-detecting-vampires?p=1483740#post1483740\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When in doubt, take a sneaky pic with your camera phone. If its a vamp, it got no reflection and won't show up in the image.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ain't the case for 2nd ed requiem anymore, taking a photo of a vamp will now simply have the vamp instinctively position himself in a way that you can't see his face.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-11T16:52:37-07:00","id":1483763,"title":"","content":"I wonder if the Lover's Telephone would work. If they answer, it means that either someone killed the original person and assumed their identity or you are talking to the living dead.<br /> <br /> Another option is the classic, see if they flinch when you light a cigarette, then &quot;accidentally&quot; burn them with it. If they flee in a panic, its a vampire (or someone with pyrophobia). They will also want to stay away from fireplaces, even with a safety grid. <br /> <br /> They could also make an extended intelligence + Occult roll to research a talisman or charm that shakes when one is near (like a Witcher's amulet). This is probably the most reliable method.<br /> <br /> Lastly, look at the missing biological signs. If a vampire is too far gone that they do not bother with mimicking life, their breath will not show up on windows, since they don't breathe. Their body will always be room temperature. Vampires don't slow down, eat or need to use the restroom, since vitae substitutes all that. Although none of those signs confirm it, they can be a tell to watch out for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\